  "description": "Take another lap with Notch Deore 12, an enduro ebike built for relishing the descent and basking in the climb back up — again and again. Its durable 6061-T6 aluminum frame is built on balanced enduro geometry for confidence and pedaling comfort. Notch’s 160mm of Split Pivot rear suspension feels plush and efficient out on the trail, complemented by a 170mm fork for big hits. Bosch’s Performance Line CX drive system delivers 85Nm of torque for winching up the steepest shuttle trails, and a 500Wh internal battery keeps the good times rolling all day. Our on-bike storage lets you bring a bottle, tube, and tool on every ride — and leave the sweaty hip pack at home. Shimano’s time-tested Deore 12-speed drivetrain delivers smooth, precise shifts and has all the gear range you’ll need for sawtooth route profiles. Notch: The sun might give up before you do.\n\nMeets UL 2849, and UL 2271 certification",
